# Where the built site looks for the API.
#
# The API runs on Render, the site on Vercel/Netlify — two different
# addresses, so the full URL has to be baked in at build time.
# Change this line if the API ever moves, then rebuild.
#
# If you later serve the site and the API from ONE domain (the nginx or
# cPanel setup in DEPLOY.md), leave this empty instead — the site will then
# call /api on its own address.
VITE_API_URL=https://obdlighting-api.onrender.com
